[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

; A chapter break. Act Three ends with the reel in hand and Act Four is the way
; out, so this says so and gets out of the way.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"built_end_card"
title = "End of Act Three"
byline = "Reel 9-C is in your jacket."
hand = 0
body = "Act Four — The Gate

The way out is up, and you have walked it once
already in the dark.

Put this down to go on."
